  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Portents you have already used today become incredibly easy to repeat.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ability to place two copies of the same least portent into an active deck</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may spend 2 fate points to look through your active deck for a portent that matches a portent in your discard pile. Reveal this portent, put it into your hand, then shuffle your active deck. This is a move action that provokes attacks of opportunity. This ability can cause you to exceed your maximum hand size, but cannot be used if your maximum hand size is already exceeded.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc0\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
